<title>BELGIUM: LANDBOUWKREDIET TO SELL 5.95% 10/5/5 MORTGAGE.</title>
<headline>LANDBOUWKREDIET TO SELL 5.95% 10/5/5 MORTGAGE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian bank Landbouwkrediet/ Credit Agricole said on Thursday it would start selling a 20-year mortgage with a fixed interest rate of 5.95 percent for the first 10-years.</p>
<p>The mortgage is of the &quot;10/5/5&quot; type with interest rates revisable after 10 and 15 years.</p>
<p>&quot;No other Belgian bank has at the moment lower rates than Landbouwkrediet for similar products,&quot; the bank said in a statement. It said it would start selling the mortgages from February 1.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
